verbs := []string{"Shake", "Dance", "Move", "Groove", "Jump", "Bounce"}
nouns := []string{"Body", "Beat", "Rhythm", "Floor", "Party", "Feet"}
The output should be formatted as a dataframe with one column labeled "Song Titles." Can you provide me with the necessary Go code to accomplish this task? Thank you.

