	for _, title := range titles {
		fmt.Println(title)
	}
}
```
This code uses the `math/rand` package to randomly select verbs and nouns from the provided lists. It then concatenates the verb and noun to create a song title. The resulting titles are stored in a slice and printed to the console in a dataframe format.

