How can I use PHP to create a dynamic web page that displays a list of products with their prices, descriptions, and images? Can you provide a sample PHP code that fetches the product data from a MySQL database and displays it in an HTML table?
Assuming you have a MySQL database with a table named "products" that contains columns for "name", "price", "description", and "image_url", you can use the following PHP code to fetch the data and display it in an HTML table:
```php
<?php
// Connect to the database
